** Node forces on a node set split between the processes, Dirichlet conditions on split node sets, and
** per-node outputs of the net force and the solution there: each process acts on the part of a set whose
** degrees of freedom it holds (vectors of the subdomain); the output gathers the whole set.
*material, name=VonMises, id=myMaterial, provider=edelweiss
210000, 0.3, 550, 1000, 200, 1400, 1

*section, name=section1, material=myMaterial, type=plane, thickness=1
all

*job, name=c3d8job, domain=2d
*solver, solver=NEDMPI, name=theSolver
output-frequency=5
*modelGenerator, generator=planeRectQuad, name=gen
l=10
h=10
nX=4
nY=4
elType=CPE4
elProvider=edelweiss

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, name=PRight, nSet=gen_right, field=displacement, result=P, saveHistory=True
>>perNode, name=URight, nSet=gen_right, field=displacement, result=U, saveHistory=True

*output, type=monitor, name=monitor
fieldOutput=PRight
fieldOutput=URight

*step, type=adaptiveForExplicitSimulations, solver=theSolver
maxInc=1e0, minInc=1e-2, maxNumInc=10000, maxIter=25, stepLength=1
>>dirichlet, name=left, nSet=gen_left, field=displacement, 1=0, 2=0
>>dirichlet, name=top, nSet=gen_top, field=displacement, 2=0.05
>>nodeforces, name=pull, nSet=gen_right, components='200, -50', field=displacement
